Subject: [PATCH 101/159] dt-bindings: regulator: Add Qualcomm PM8150L LCDB

Document the LCD bias block of PM8150L and list it as a PMIC child.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
---
 .../bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml          |  4 ++
 .../bindings/regulator/qcom,pm8150l-lcdb.yaml | 55 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/qcom,pm8150l-lcdb.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml
index 7a889d888383..ffa03396edd0 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/qcom,spmi-pmic.yaml
